<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "見えない光_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Now then, <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">At last, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">'s smile was completely gone from her face.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="2">, I'd heard, used to have a personality like this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hadn't met her yet back then, and I'd heard she'd been a gloomy girl who didn't trust people much and shut herself up in her shell.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>, if it's hard for you to say, can I bring it up myself?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="2"> had completely forgotten about the pizza.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">No, the pizza had never been the point to begin with.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>, you don't seem to want to leave <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> alone. Are you worried about the Megasawa City case, by any chance?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Wha...!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"If so, you must be uneasy, right?
{PAUSE ""}
　Let's quietly follow <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, starting now. If we can talk while we follow her and keep watch, there's no problem, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "7000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">It was a pretty good idea, but </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> had already caught on to something.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Her being quick on the uptake was a help, but...</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "59" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\quiet-residential-area1.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">We followed </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> out of the apartment.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "Take_It.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エレベーター前.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hmm hmm hmmm."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was humming as she waited for the elevator.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\シナリオ\外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>, you want to know, don't you? About the case in Central Park. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> gets scared of cases like this, and yet you called me over, knowing I was looking into it. 
{PAUSE ""}
You know I'm the type who itches to talk about this kind of thing, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\エレベーター.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エレベーター前.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">We waited for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> to get on the elevator, then headed for the stairs.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション階段昼.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>, you know about the Megasawa City case in Iizawa Prefecture, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, I know. I lived there until 3 years ago."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I told her honestly. There was no point in hiding it.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Huh? Really? Until 3 years ago? I didn't know that."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Come to think of it, I hadn't told </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> that, had I?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">But</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> from there, she'd quickly work her way to me being the culprit.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\エレベーター.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">When we got down to the first floor, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was just stepping out of the elevator.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> didn't notice us and headed for the building's exit.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション前.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Feeling healthy is wonderful! Maybe I'll take a stroll on the way!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">It looked like she was walking to the convenience store, not biking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">This way, I could also buy time to talk with </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"The cases that happened in Megasawa City come up now and then, don't they? 
{PAUSE ""}
If I remember right, 3 years ago, 6 years ago, 10 years ago. They always happen on April 8. 
{PAUSE ""}
And this time, it happened here, in Motoki-cho. You were in Megasawa City until 3 years ago, weren't you, <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">―We sneaked along after </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\なつみ追跡.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="1">... Aren't </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> scared of me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Scared? Of course I'm not! Why would I be scared of you, <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
　Don't tell me you're going to say that you, <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>, are the culprit behind today's case and the Megasawa City case?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">What if I said I was?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Impossible."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You answered that right away, huh?"</STYLE><PG>
"Oh, and also, I found out by asking around that something similar happened in Central Park on April 8, 12 years ago. 
{PAUSE ""}
Well, it seems that one was an accident, but for now, let's suppose it's connected to this case and the Megasawa City case."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She already knew even about </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">my dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>, how about it? If you're calling <STYLE ID="1">yourself</STYLE> the culprit, don't you know why the cases happen on April 8 at intervals like these?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"They're memorial service years. </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">My dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s third-year, seventh-year, tenth-year memorial services. And today is his thirteenth-year memorial."</STYLE> [TN: Buddhist memorials count the year of death as the first year.]<PG>
"Huh? <STYLE ID="6">Senpai, your father</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
Is that so... I didn't know that..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. I kept it from </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too. He died trying to get back a balloon </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">she</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'d let fly away."</STYLE><PG>
"I see... I can understand why that'd be hard to bring up, but..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Get it? The Megasawa City case and this case alike, they've got plenty to do with me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I'll go with that for now. It seems like it isn't completely unrelated, anyway. 
{PAUSE ""}
But tenth-year memorials don't normally exist, do they? Is it a sect thing?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I don't know about all that. I don't know about other sects, but my family has one."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Well, Shinto does have something like a tenth-year memorial, called the tenth-year rite."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Just then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> turned to look back our way.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">We hurried to hide behind a utility pole.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考える.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Just my imagination...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">With that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> started walking again.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Before we knew it, we'd closed in so far that we could hear </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> talking to herself.</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>, you're carrying something all by yourself right now, aren't you? Especially about <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
What on earth is it that you can't talk about in front of <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\コンビニ昼.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "700" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">We reached the convenience store, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> went in with a light step.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">We waited a little way from the store, and I told her about my past.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">My dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, the bullying, the curse, the shinigami.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The whole time, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> kept rubbing my back.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>... that must have been hard. You couldn't tell <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, couldn't tell <STYLE ID="7">your mother</STYLE>, all alone this whole time..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You think it's stupid, right? That I cursed people, called up a shinigami, and killed them..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I do think the curse and the shinigami are strange, but it's certain that murders connected to them have happened. 
{PAUSE ""}
Which means the one killed this time was someone written on the paper dolls..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">So that's it...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">So in this morning's case, </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Natsumi's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> died...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">She'd said he'd been on a business trip since yesterday, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> hadn't seemed to check for herself that her </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> was safe.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Natsumi's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... Next it'll be </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">her mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Goto<STYLE ID="1">, help me...! I don't want to kill anyone else!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">There on a street with people passing by, I was close to tears.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Goto<STYLE ID="2"> said nothing, rose on her toes, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="な">patted</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> my head.</STYLE><PG>
"I'll do everything I can, too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="1">, you believe what I told you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I believe half of it. But the curse part, I'm sorry, but..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Well, that was only natural. In </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">'s position, I'd have said the same.</STYLE><PG>
"But <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>. I think protecting <STYLE ID="3">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> is going to be very hard. 
{PAUSE ""}
After all, even though the culprit kills by a fixed rule, they've succeeded every single time. 
{PAUSE ""}
You could say this is a criminal who's very practiced at it."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I didn't care. I couldn't just stand by and lose the life I'd finally gotten.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">If I lost that, I'd be as good as dead.</STYLE><PG>
"So... 
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
let's give up."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Wha...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Give up? Give up on what?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Don't tell me she was saying we should give up on saving </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I nearly lunged at </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> over a judgment that cold.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">But </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> winked, holding an index finger upright against her lips.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">What's that supposed to mean...?</STYLE><PG>
<TXSPS>"Heh... 
{PAUSE ""}
heh..."<PG>
{QUAKE "人物1,メッセージボックス" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="11">"Ah-CHOO!</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2"><TXSPN>Suddenly, </STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2"> let out a huge sneeze.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>, I'm sorry! I got snot all over your clothes, <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "ごろごろゲームする日_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ew...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
